{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04612","headline":"城南亭作 · 张说","name":"城南亭作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珂马朝归连万石，矟门洞啓亲迎客。\n北堂珍重琥珀酒，庭前列肆茱萸席。\n长袖迟回意绪多，清商缓转[目]腾波。\n旧传比翼侯家舞，新出将雏主第歌。\n汉家绦灌余兵气，晋代浮虚安足贵。\n正逢天下金镜清，偏加日饮醇醪意。\n谁复遨游不复归，闲庭莫畏不芳菲。\n会待城南春色至，竟将花柳拂罗衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}